Independent project in the Nexora family. Not affiliated with TypeSafe AI, Apple, Convai Innovations or Mole.
The product name does not imply that TypeSafe Jev weights or a hosted TypeSafe service are bundled.

Mandatory local inference uses laya-mlx (Apache-2.0), an independent MLX port by mizorewww,
and aac6fef/laya-mlx model weights derived from Convai Innovations Laya (Apache-2.0).
Weights are not distributed in this repository. See model setup and docs/RESEARCH.md for pinned provenance.

Mole's documented interface was researched as a comparison; no Mole source code or assets were copied.
